{"id":"durak","lemma":"дурак","pos":"noun","rank":928,"glosses":["fool, simpleton, idiot (stupid person with poor judgment)","durak (a simple card game in which the last player holding cards in their hand is the loser)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/80/Ru-%D0%B4%D1%83%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BA.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D1%83%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BA.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"дурака","plural":"дураки","feminine":"дура"},"examples":[{"text":"Думаешь, я дурак?","en":"Do you think I'm a fool?","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"I"},null]},{"text":"Я знаю, ты не дурак.","en":"I know you're not an idiot.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Вы меня за дурака держите?","en":"Do you take me for a fool?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"behind / for"},null,{"g":"to hold","l":"держать"}]},{"text":"Ты думаешь, мы все дураки?","en":"Do you think we're all stupid?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"everyone, everybody"},null]},{"text":"Какой я был дурак!","en":"What a fool I was!","words":[{"g":"what, what one"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]}]}